  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Community Social Cohesion (CSP) Project: Strengthening Social Cohesion in Cabo Delgado and Niassa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is to increase social cohesion and resilience to radicalisation in five instability-affected districts of northern Mozambique. This will be achieved through the completion of two outcomes: Outcome 1: Increased trust between host residents and IDPs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outcome 2: Improved collaboration amongst key stakeholders working in conflict-related matters.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
